🎯 Choosing the Right Collection

| Requirement            | Recommended Collection |
| ---------------------- | ---------------------- |
| Fast Random Access     | ArrayList              |
| Frequent Insert/Delete | LinkedList             |
| Unique Values          | HashSet                |
| Sorted Data            | TreeSet                |
| Key-Value Storage      | HashMap                |
| Priority Processing    | PriorityQueue          |

---

⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using ArrayList when frequent insertions are needed
❌ Using HashSet when order matters
❌ Ignoring Generics

```java id="e1"
ArrayList list =
        new ArrayList();
```

---

🧠 Real Insight

👉 Most enterprise applications heavily use:

* ArrayList
* HashMap
* HashSet
* PriorityQueue

These collections are also among the most frequently asked interview topics.

